# Unrestricted M_S=0 O2 with the two pi_g electrons in m=+1 alpha and
# m=-1 beta: M_L=0, but the reflection through the axis maps the
# determinant onto the orthogonal one with the spins swapped, so it is
# an equal mixture of Sigma+ and Sigma- (of 1Sigma_g+ and the M_S=0
# component of 3Sigma_g-).
System O2.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method hyb_gga_xc_b3lyp
Multiplicity 1
Restricted false
ComplexBasis true
LinearOccupations -1
LinearOccupationFile complex_orbs_o2_open_singlet.linocc
JKMethod Cholesky
DFTGrid 75 -302
ConvThr 1e-7
SaveChk complex_orbs_o2_b3lyp_open_singlet.chk
